+
+**Two REAL fidelity/behavior bugs found BY the new tests (the reason
+the tests exist):**
+
+1. The -100 ft stack was scaled by space_factor_ (kickout → -200 ft).
+   The reference applies flightIdx * -100.0F RAW (bvrengage.cpp:3378,
